{"id":"vod_md_3164","vodId":"3164","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"四月是你的谎言","name_cn":"四月是你的谎言","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"22集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230824-1/2def97604a2a0ded54a4cd3cfd57c9b6.jpg"},"summary":"从很小的时候起，在母亲的引导和教导下，有马公生（花江夏树 配音）便将成为优秀的钢琴师当做了自己的毕生理想，一路走来，亦斩获了不少佳绩。不幸的是，在11岁那年，有马的母亲去世了，而有马亦再也无法听见自己所演奏的琴声，如此一来，他同自己最初的梦想渐行渐远。在念初三那年，一位名叫宫园薰（种田梨沙 配音）的女生出现在了有马的身边，薰演奏的乐器是小提琴。很快，有马便被薰身上所散发出来的才情和热情所吸引了。让有马没有想到的是，薰竟然指定有马成为她比赛中的伴奏，在薰的影响下，有马渐渐重燃了对于钢琴的热爱，他和薰之间的距离也因此越来越近。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,音乐"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-24 07:46:34","classic":true,"classicRank":25,"franchise":"四月是你的谎言","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/R4sOVbP8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/UdARqeJw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/nHNkReid/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/HTELm2c0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/owL1hLW5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/ulArVbw7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/33Mr21mt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/pxt4m96I/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/NKoyz4HV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/TAehpz6n/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/g4NBSXw1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/9PHYdAD3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/GPllhkr3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/rhq75pbP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/OelEEz